## This Repository

This repository contains a Korean-language adaptation of the original
book: the chapters have been split into per-chapter files, translated
into Korean, and the mathematical formulas rewritten in MathJax syntax.
This constitutes an "adaptation" under the terms above.

Accordingly, all adapted content in this repository
is likewise licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial
4.0 International License (CC BY-NC 4.0):
<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0>

